\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Remark}
\title{The algebraic closure}
\date{2026-11-13}

\p{The algebraic closure in this definition is #{\cl{\mathbb Q}},
the overline of the field. Conjugation is the overline of a
scalar. Algebra writes the same overline for the closure.}
